&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/181193/rss" title="voxjong.com" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;VoxJong: 3D CSS Mahjong Solitaire&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — A lovely isometric implementation of Mahjong created with CSS. It uses a CSS voxel engine called &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/181194/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;VoxCSS&lt;/a&gt; under the hood.&lt;/p&gt;

